{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415706","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415706","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041570601:0":{"text":"그 손은... 넝쿨인가?","source_cn":"你的双手……是藤蔓？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7D9A08DCB5A14C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570602:0":{"text":"굉장히 특별해 보여서 실례를 무릅쓰고 물어볼 수밖에 없었어.","source_cn":"请恕我冒昧。但它们看起来非常奇特。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x606B53517DF7DA56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570603:1":{"text":"괜찮아. 이건 내 친구가 발명한 급속 성장 덩굴 의수라는 물건이지.","source_cn":"没关系，这是我一位朋友发明的速生藤义肢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA46476EC7331C4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570604:1":{"text":"보다시피 난 전장에서 양팔을 모두 잃은 병사였네.","source_cn":"如你所见，我曾是一名士兵，双臂都毁于战场上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15D62D29C8D78ABD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570605:1":{"text":"하지만 다행히 운이 좋아서 다미안이라는 작은 발명가를 알게 되었지.","source_cn":"幸好我运气不错，偶然结识了达米安，他是个小发明家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x269F2ACF600808C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570606:1":{"text":"넝쿨 의수라... 신기하군.","source_cn":"藤蔓义肢……果然神奇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C59289A304B39CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570607:1":{"text":"튼튼한가? 계속 쓸 수도 있고?","source_cn":"它足够坚固吗？可以一直使用下去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF300CFBB9A28AAC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570608:1":{"text":"이걸로 검을 막을 생각은 하면 안 되지. 생활을 조금 더 편하게 해주는 것뿐이야.","source_cn":"你不能期待藤蔓抵挡刀剑。它能做的，只是让我的生活更便利一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC437762F17ADDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570609:1":{"text":"내구도라면 그다지 나쁘지 않지만, 가끔 교체가 필요하지.","source_cn":"至于耐用性，不算太差，但时不时也需要更换。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAFD6887D68B1F20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570610:1":{"text":"다미안 그 녀석, 지난번에도 몇 가지 다른 재질의 팔을 준비했다면서 전부 나에게 시험해 보겠다고 하더군. 정말이지...","source_cn":"达米安那小子上次还说他多准备了几种不同材质的手臂，就等...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CF78C92C8C1D71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570611:1":{"text":"그런 친구가 있다는 건 행운이군.","source_cn":"有这样一位朋友，你很幸运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C57F1E7A5D2EA4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570612:1":{"text":"맞아.","source_cn":"的确。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B62A2E4E5CFCF53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570613:1":{"text":"의수에 꽤 관심이 있어 보이는군. 이런 건 필요 없어 보이는데 말이야.","source_cn":"你对义肢很感兴趣？看起来你并不需要这种东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AAF8AF7268E344C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570614:1":{"text":"...내 밑에는 전쟁으로 돌이킬 수 없는 상처를 입은 병사들이 많으니까.","source_cn":"……我手下有很多士兵。战争让他们遭受了不可逆转的损伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DD8F7134D1C2ECC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570615:1":{"text":"...알겠네.","source_cn":"……我明白了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21AF200BB750A64F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570616:1":{"text":"그렇게 병사들을 생각하다니, 훌륭한 지휘관이군.","source_cn":"有这种体恤士兵的想法，足以见得你是一位好将领。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B67CD53FEF2858F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570617:1":{"text":"기회가 된다면 다미안에게 데려가 주지. 분명 네 고민을 해결할 수 있는 다양한 방법을 가지고 있을 테니까.","source_cn":"如果有机会，我可以带你去见见达米安。他应该有不少鬼点子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEAE59E8D8482FBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570618:1":{"text":"그런 날이 오기를 바라겠네.","source_cn":"希望会有那么一天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C1CA5E98183E776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:珀尔修斯":{"text":"페르세우스","source":"珀尔修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:科林":{"text":"콜린","source":"科林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}